## Where to dig deeper

- `profile.json`: the full machine-readable profile, including evidence references.
- `APP-MAP.md` and `appmap.sqlite` in each run directory: routes, endpoints, forms and flows.
- `appmap query` (recipes such as `flows`, `role-matrix`, `endpoint-shape`, or read-only `sql`) for specifics.
- `profile-names.yaml`: edit the purpose and feature names and descriptions, then re-run `appmap profile`.
